OL,3,GNEWSAHealth minister instructs trusts
OL,4,Ato pause cuts to Phone First service
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health minister has
OL,7,Finstructed trusts which have not yet
OL,8,Fstood down their Phone First service to
OL,9,F"pause any planned cessation" of the
OL,10,Fscheme.
OL,12,FThe telephone triage system has already
OL,13,Fbeen scrapped by the Belfast Trust; it
OL,14,Fwas to end within weeks in the Northern
OL,15,FTrust and is under review in the
OL,16,FWestern Trust.
OL,18,FPhone First is aimed at reducing
OL,19,Funnecessary visits to hospital
OL,20,Femergency departments (EDs) by
OL,21,Fproviding advice to patients on
OL,22,Fappropriate care options.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
