OL,3,GNEWSAHealth minister instructs trusts
OL,4,Ato pause cuts to Phone First service
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement to BBC News NI, the
OL,7,FDepartment of Health (DoH) said health
OL,8,Ftrusts that have not yet stood the
OL,9,Fservice down will be "liaising with
OL,10,Ftheir external providers for an
OL,11,Fextension".
